        <div class="impact-banner" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-7">
              <div class="impact-content">
                <h3 class="mb-3">Office of the Deputy Rector (Admin)</h3>

                <p>
                  Dr. Uzoma Friday Ibeaja
                  The Office of the Deputy Rector (Administration) manages the institution’s administrative functions.
                  This office oversees staff recruitment, development, and welfare, as well as the maintenance of
                  facilities and resources.</p>

                <p>The Deputy Rector (Administration) ensures smooth day-to-day operations, handles non-academic
                  policies, and coordinates the activities of administrative units to support the institution’s overall
                  goal</p>
                <div class="impact-buttons">
                  <a href="/mission-vision-objectives" class="btn-donate">Our Vision</a>
                  <a href="/rector-message" class="btn-learn-more">Rector's Message <i
                      class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5">
              <div class="impact-image">
                <img src="website-assets/img/council/14.png" alt="Student scholarship recipients" class="img-fluid">
                <div class="impact-stat">
                  <i class="bi bi-person-circle me-2"></i>
                  <span class="stat-text">Dr. Uzoma Friday Ibeaja</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

    <section id="leadership" class="leadership section">

      <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">

        <div class="row mb-5">
          <div class="col-lg-12" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="200">
            <h3 class="section-subtitle mb-3">Profile of the Deputy Rector (Admin)</h3>
            <div class="stats-container">
              <p>Dr. Uzoma Friday Ibeaja is the Deputy Rector (Administration) at Federal Polytechnic, Nekede, Owerri.
                Born on May 27, 1967, in Obiohia Nvurunvu Uturu, Abia State, he holds a B.Sc. in Accountancy and an MBA
                in Banking and Finance from Abia State University. He further obtained an M.Sc. (2001) and a Ph.D.
                (2009) in Accountancy from Imo State University, Owerri</p>

              <p>Dr. Ibeaja is affiliated with several professional bodies, including the Association of National
                Accountants of Nigeria (ANAN), the Nigerian Institute of Strategic Management (NISM), and he is a Fellow
                of the Chartered Institute of Taxation of Nigeria (CITN).</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section><!-- /Leadership Section -->


